    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:1",
      "title": "Episode 1",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2022-04-08T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "It's been three years since EXO members went on a trip to Kaohsiung and Kenting, and they have gathered once again for Season Three! For this season, they'll head to Namhae. And the members start the first round of the ladder game to pick the theme of this trip!",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/1/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649641
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:2",
      "title": "Episode 2",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "2022-04-08T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "EXO decides who will drive the car through the \"Ladder Game.\" Once they get in the car, they are given quiz questions about Namhae. The member who wins the most points will even receive a prize. After the drive, the EXO boys arrive at a hot spot in Namhae, which boasts beautiful scenery. They get to see another celebrity's congratulation message video. They are also given a mission to prove their strong teamwork. They have to take pictures together in poses that require cooperation!",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/2/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649642
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:3",
      "title": "Episode 3",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 3,
      "number": 3,
      "released": "2022-04-15T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The EXO boys successfully take all the eight \"Cool Kids Pictures\" in Seomi Garden. They stop by a coffee shop with an ocean view, where SEHUN gets to buy coffee for the whole staff upon a round of \"Ladder Game.\" On their first evening of the Namhae tour, the boys try jeonboksotbap, doenjang jjigae, and gambas. They also play the \"Frying Pan\" to decide who will make breakfast on the second day.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/3/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649643
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:4",
      "title": "Episode 4",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 4,
      "number": 4,
      "released": "2022-04-15T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "The Exo boys head to Namhae Market to buy groceries and stop by a supermarket, where SUHO gets ingredients for breakfast. They arrive at their relaxing lodging with a private pool and decide on the two members who will be using the bedrooms.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/4/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649644
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:5",
      "title": "Episode 5",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 5,
      "number": 5,
      "released": "2022-04-22T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The EXO boys enjoy playing and relaxing in the heated pool. The boys take on a part-time job to gut three boxes of anchovies to make up for the overspent budget. They also play a ladder game to decide on a supervisor to assign the amount of work. And KAI grills ogyeopsal, which they enjoy over drinks and an honest conversation.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/5/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649645
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:6",
      "title": "Episode 6",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 6,
      "number": 6,
      "released": "2022-04-22T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "On the second morning of the trip, SUHO cooks Philly cheese sandwiches catered to the members' tastes and preferences. The EXO boys enjoy breakfast on the patio overlooking the Namhae sea. After D.O. washes the dishes thoroughly as promised, the boys set off for the beach.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/6/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649646
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:7",
      "title": "Episode 7",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 7,
      "number": 7,
      "released": "2022-05-06T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "EXO arrives at Songjeong Solbaram Beach. The boys play \"Hopscotch\" against SEHUN, who says he has an undefeated record in the game. They also play foot volleyball against five athletic staff members, where the winning team will be granted a wish. KAI makes a delicious dish of gochujang dakbongjorim to have with seafood and myeolchissambap for lunch.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/7/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649647
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:8",
      "title": "Episode 8",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 8,
      "number": 8,
      "released": "2022-05-06T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "EXO members play a fun round of \"Sound Quiz.\" After KAI is done with the dishes, the boys set off to Seolri Skywalk. They have a thrilling experience, walking on the bridge stretching into the sea. And XIUMIN is chosen to ride the sky swing and watch the beautiful sunset up close.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/8/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649648
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:9",
      "title": "Episode 9",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 9,
      "number": 9,
      "released": "2022-05-13T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Leaving the Seolri Skywalk behind, the EXO boys visit the German Village in Namhae, where they buy goods and items made in Germany. At a pub located in the village, the boys play seven different games to secure seven dinner menus. Back at the lodging, the members are given individual missions of varying difficulty levels to be executed overnight.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/9/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649649
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:10",
      "title": "Episode 10",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 10,
      "number": 10,
      "released": "2022-05-13T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "XIUMIN gets caught taking selfies with the members. They suspect D.O. of trying to prevent them from accomplishing all the missions. SUHO makes a plan and studies the recipe for the lemon marmalade. And KAI has a hard time trying to keep the Eri lightstick on. Meanwhile, SEHUN gets ready to use the eyeliner while everyone is sleeping.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/10/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649650
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:11",
      "title": "Episode 11",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 11,
      "number": 11,
      "released": "2022-05-20T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "EXO goes paragliding at the top of Mangunsan Mountain. Although scared at first, all the members enjoy the exciting experience of flying in the sky in nature. The boys head back to the lodging to check out the result of the missions from yesterday.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/11/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649651
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:3:12",
      "title": "Episode 12",
      "season": 3,
      "episode": 12,
      "number": 12,
      "released": "2022-05-20T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "KAI and SEHUN fail to complete their mission, so they dive into the pool as a penalty. For their final meal of the trip, the EXO boys enjoy an array of fresh seafood dishes. And they look back on the three-day trip to Namhae.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/3/12/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 3649652
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:4:1",
      "title": "Episode 1",
      "season": 4,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2023-08-11T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The members of EXO gather once again. In this season, they go to Geojeo Island and Tongyeong, and their first job is to choose the van that they'll drive. They play \"Mystery Yes or No Quiz\" on the way to lunch, so check out who gets the most answers right.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/4/1/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 4668223
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:4:2",
      "title": "Episode 2",
      "season": 4,
      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "2023-08-11T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "The members get different meals according to the results of the \"Mystery Yes or No Quiz.\" Then, they're split into Team EX and Team XO and go to Geoje Botanical Garden for the next mission.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/4/2/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 4668224
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:4:3",
      "title": "Episode 3",
      "season": 4,
      "episode": 3,
      "number": 3,
      "released": "2023-08-18T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "The members go to Jungle Dome in Geoje. They’re divided into Team EX and Team XO, and the first team that finishes all the missions gets to incubate the eggs. They face a few hardships along the way, so check out which team clears the missions first.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/4/3/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 4668225
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:4:4",
      "title": "Episode 4",
      "season": 4,
      "episode": 4,
      "number": 4,
      "released": "2023-08-18T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "Team EX and Team XO will determine the winner of the mission. The qualified, the winners, get to enter the incubation site and declare their victory. Next, they go to have dinner, which isn’t easily given to the losing team. Don’t miss out on their funny banter.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt28613356/4/4/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 4668226
    },
    {
      "id": "tt28613356:4:5",
      "title": "Episode 5",
      "season": 4,
      "episode": 5,
      "number": 5,
      "released": "2023-08-25T00:00:00.000Z",
